@fact brask.owl
# en: The old barn owl in the stable loft has outlived three of her colleagues. She would not say which loss hurt most.
text [88c4c3] = 马厩阁楼上那只老仓鸮，比她的三位同事都活得长。哪一次失去最让她难过，她不肯说。

@fact brask.courtesies
# en: She bows to the things that live in the Whisperwood, and believes it's why they have never bitten her. Much.
text [ce36dc] = 她会向住在低语森林里的东西鞠躬，并相信正因如此它们从没咬过她。基本没有。
